msgctxt "248"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "269"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "279"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "285"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "306"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "338"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "373"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "401"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "421"
msgid "That'll be %s, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "441"
msgid ""
"This tuna's still got a ton of energy. Just look at it flop\n"
"around. Okinawa's got some tasty fish in its waters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "554"
msgid ""
"Gurukun is a popular fish in Okinawa. Fry it up, bake \n"
"it with a bit of salt, or eat it raw. Either way, you'll \n"
"love it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"This is freshly-caught abasa, which is what we here \n"
"call blowfish. Most folks like to fry it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "774"
msgid ""
"Fresh mibai, also called grouper. You want my \n"
"advice? Cook it up with garlic and butter. Now that's\n"
"tasty!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "882"
msgid ""
"This is freshly-caught irabucha, which is what we call\n"
"parrot fish. Just look at those tropical colors. Tastes\n"
"great with vinegar miso sauce."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"This fresh turban is the largest of its kind. Cut it into\n"
"thin strips of sashimi, and you'll find it's tasty and \n"
"crunchy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1147"
msgid "Filleted horse mackerel is great for bait."
msgstr "Filetti di sugarello: ottime esche."

msgctxt "1190"
msgid "Filleted squid makes good bait."
msgstr "Il calamaro sfilettato è un'ottima esca."

msgctxt "1222"
msgid "This shrimp makes fine bait."
msgstr "Questo gambero è un'esca eccellente."

msgctxt "1251"
msgid "This pickled squid makes good fishing bait."
msgstr "Questo calamaro marinato è un'ottima esca."
